<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{!showSuccess}}" style="height: {{safeTop}}px;"></view>

  <!-- Web: top-4 -->
  <view class="back motion-fade-up motion-delay-1" wx:if="{{!showSuccess}}" style="top: {{safeTop + 16}}px;" bindtap="goBack">
    <view class="back-btn" hover-class="back-btn--active" hover-stay-time="80">
      <image class="back-icon" src="/images/icons/arrow-left.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="content motion-fade-up motion-delay-2" wx:if="{{!showSuccess}}">
    <view class="title-wrap motion-fade-up motion-delay-2">
      <text class="title">删除账户 🗑️</text>
      <text class="sub">这是一个需要慎重考虑的决定</text>
    </view>

    <view class="config-tip motion-fade-up motion-delay-3" wx:if="{{serviceMissing}}">
      <text class="config-tip__title">需要配置云托管服务名</text>
      <text class="config-tip__desc">请在 miniprogram/config.js 中填写 cloudRunService（用于 X-WX-SERVICE）</text>
    </view>

    <view class="warn-card motion-fade-up motion-delay-3">
      <view class="warn-icon-wrap">
        <image class="warn-icon" src="/images/icons/alert-triangle-red.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <text class="warn-title">⚠️ 温馨提醒</text>

      <view class="warn-body">
        <text class="warn-p">
          亲爱的小伙伴，删除账户就像是把你的
          <text class="warn-highlight"> 拾光小秘密 </text>
          全部装进时光机，然后按下"永久消失"按钮 🚀
        </text>
        <text class="warn-p">这意味着：</text>
        <view class="warn-list">
          <text class="warn-li">📸 所有珍藏的照片会消失不见</text>
          <text class="warn-li">📅 所有预约记录会烟消云散</text>
          <text class="warn-li">👤 你的账户信息会彻底清空</text>
          <text class="warn-li">⏰ 这个操作 <text class="warn-danger">无法撤销</text></text>
        </view>
        <text class="warn-p warn-p--tip">
          💡 如果只是想暂时休息一下，可以选择"退出登录"哦~ 这样你的数据仍然存在，随时欢迎你回来！✨
        </text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="error motion-pop-in" wx:if="{{error}}">
      <text class="error-text">{{error}}</text>
    </view>

    <button class="btn-next" hover-class="btn-next--active" wx:if="{{!showConfirm}}" bindtap="openConfirm" disabled="{{serviceMissing}}">
      我已了解风险，继续删除
    </button>

    <view class="confirm-box motion-pop-in" wx:if="{{showConfirm}}">
      <view class="confirm-tip">
        <text class="confirm-tip-text">🤔 真的要说再见了吗？</text>
      </view>

      <view class="confirm-actions">
        <button class="btn-ghost" hover-class="btn-ghost--active" bindtap="cancelConfirm">再想想</button>
        <button class="btn-danger" hover-class="btn-danger--active" bindtap="submitDelete" disabled="{{isDeleting}}">
          {{isDeleting ? '删除中...' : '🗑️ 确认删除'}}
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="success-page motion-fade-in" wx:if="{{showSuccess}}">
    <view class="success-wrap motion-pop-in">
      <view class="success-icon-wrap">
        <image class="success-icon" src="/images/icons/circle-check-yellow.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <text class="success-title">再见啦，小伙伴！👋</text>
      <text class="success-desc">你的账户已经安全删除，所有数据都已清空。</text>
      <text class="success-desc">期待未来某天能再次相遇~ ✨</text>
      <text class="success-warning" wx:if="{{postDeleteWarning}}">{{postDeleteWarning}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
